<title>
Heater Shut Off Valve Inspection
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove heater shut off valve. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check resistance between terminals of heater shut off valve connector (1).
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If measured resistance is out of specified range, replace heater shut off valve. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Heater shut off valve resistance
</title>
<ptxt>
20 &#176;C (68 &#176;F): 14.5 to 16.1 k&#937;
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162036.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "43.224mm" ver = "01" gw = "189" gh = "106"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
